NXPocketApple notice

This file records where the project comes from and what it depends on. The licence text is in LICENSE.

NXPocketApple is an independent shell: it holds a library of games, imports packages a Mac app built, signs them on the
device, and starts one. The engine that runs a game is not part of this repository.

